%% NoticeViews::handshakeView — sequence rendering (view def SequenceView)
%% not represented: attribute def Kit::Level has no place in a sequence rendering; it is not shown
%% not represented: a connect in Talk::Handshake states no direction; a sequence rendering shows directed messages only
%% not represented: message pending states no source and target; no message is drawn
%% not represented: message adrift attaches to monitor.tapped, which is on no lifeline the rendering shows; no message is drawn
sequenceDiagram
  participant n0 as «part»<br>caller
  participant n1 as «part»<br>callee
  n0->>n0: echo
  n0->>n1: of Ping
